00:17:13.583 --> 00:17:17.043
We can't compete against that
much stock footage of clouds!

00:17:17.128 --> 00:17:18.211
We're boned!

00:17:18.963 --> 00:17:22.632
But we still have one hope,
my big televised debate!

00:17:22.717 --> 00:17:24.384
I'm our A in the hole!

00:17:24.469 --> 00:17:26.470
Professor, who's debating
for your side?

00:17:26.554 --> 00:17:30.515
That guy, you know,
I forget his name.

00:17:31.434 --> 00:17:32.851
That's him!

00:17:32.935 --> 00:17:35.729
Good evening. I'm George Takei's head and neck,

00:17:35.813 --> 00:17:38.982
your host for tonight's debate. You may applaud.

00:17:41.652 --> 00:17:43.487
We flipped a coin
before the debate,

00:17:43.571 --> 00:17:46.031
and Bender stole it,
so we'll start with him.

00:17:47.033 --> 00:17:49.409
Ladies and gentlemen
of the jury, I...

00:17:49.494 --> 00:17:51.536
Oops. Sorry,
force of habit.

00:17:52.997 --> 00:17:54.790
I support
this proposition

00:17:54.874 --> 00:17:58.710
because I love a goopy,
flesh-and-blood woman,

00:17:58.795 --> 00:18:01.213
and, not surprisingly,
she loves me.

00:18:02.465 --> 00:18:07.177
This is a simple matter of
justice, which I'm not normally for.

00:18:07.261 --> 00:18:09.304
So, please, vote yes.

00:18:09.722 --> 00:18:13.141
After all, our love isn't
any different from yours,

00:18:13.226 --> 00:18:15.310
except it's hotter,
'cause I'm involved.

00:18:18.064 --> 00:18:20.899
I haven't heard
such an eloquent speech

00:18:20.983 --> 00:18:24.194
since Bill Shatner explained
why he couldn't pay me back.

00:18:24.278 --> 00:18:26.029
Rebuttal, Professor?

00:18:26.113 --> 00:18:29.407
This $4 coffeepot
talks about love,

00:18:29.492 --> 00:18:31.910
but what he describes
is perversion!

00:18:32.036 --> 00:18:35.372
You wouldn't know perversion if
it put clamps on your testicles!

00:18:35.456 --> 00:18:38.458
You're just jealous, 'cause
you've never known true love!

00:18:38.543 --> 00:18:43.505
Oh, no? Back when I was full of
piss and vinegar, and my bed wasn't,

00:18:43.589 --> 00:18:46.091
I fell in love with
the sweetest girl

00:18:46.175 --> 00:18:49.344
ever to skip through
a field of posies.

00:18:49.428 --> 00:18:51.137
Her name was Eunice,

00:18:51.222 --> 00:18:54.266
and we spent our blissful days working in a lab,

00:18:54.350 --> 00:18:59.062
developing a poison to wipe out
that dreadful posy infestation.

00:19:01.357 --> 00:19:03.900
I thought our love
would last forever.

00:19:03.985 --> 00:19:07.612
But then, 43 years later,
she left me

00:19:08.406 --> 00:19:10.532
for a robot!

00:19:14.453 --> 00:19:19.040
How could she do that
to me, her Farnypoo!

00:19:19.125 --> 00:19:21.751
That's it?
You hate robosexuals

00:19:21.836 --> 00:19:24.629
'cause your girlfriend
left you for a robot?

00:19:24.714 --> 00:19:29.050
She didn't just leave me for
a robot, she was a robot!

00:19:32.763 --> 00:19:36.975
Oh, God, her name wasn't Eunice, it was Unit!

00:19:37.059 --> 00:19:39.269
Unit 47!

00:19:43.566 --> 00:19:47.527
My heart was broken, and
like a bitter, old picklepuss,

00:19:47.612 --> 00:19:52.782
I took it out on robosexuals
everywhere. I'm so ashamed!

00:19:54.535 --> 00:19:56.912
At the risk of
losing this debate,

00:19:56.996 --> 00:20:00.832
I beg you, support
Proposition Infinity!

00:20:02.543 --> 00:20:04.502
Give me a hug!

00:20:04.879 --> 00:20:07.380
I, too, am hugging them in spirit.

00:20:07.673 --> 00:20:12.886
And now they're hugging me back. Oh, my.

00:20:16.057 --> 00:20:20.268
In a stunning turnabout, voters
have approved Proposition Infinity.

00:20:20.353 --> 00:20:22.562
Robosexual marriage
is now legal.

00:20:22.647 --> 00:20:25.857
What's next,
gay robosexual marriage?

00:20:27.985 --> 00:20:29.402
We did it, honey!

00:20:29.487 --> 00:20:32.280
Finally, we can have
a legal, monogamous marriage,

00:20:32.365 --> 00:20:33.573
like everyone else!

00:20:33.658 --> 00:20:36.326
Yeah... Monogamous?

00:20:40.081 --> 00:20:42.916
And now,
a long-distance dedication

00:20:43.000 --> 00:20:46.962
from a squishy, green bad boy
to his pink pork dumpling.

00:20:47.046 --> 00:20:48.964
At number 12,

00:20:49.048 --> 00:20:52.968
it's Wailing Fungus with
Shut Up and Love Me.

00:20:55.054 --> 00:20:58.974
Shut up and love me
Shut up and love me

00:21:08.150 --> 00:21:11.611
Shut up and love me
Shut up and love me

00:21:11.696 --> 00:21:15.073
I told you where
I told you when

00:21:15.157 --> 00:21:19.369
I told you how
And we'll meet up at 10:00

00:21:19.453 --> 00:21:24.040
But you keep on talking
Keep on yakking

00:21:24.125 --> 00:21:28.086
Shut up and love me
